OL,3,ABiggest fibre boost could be scraps in
OL,4,Ayour bin, experts say
OL,5,
OL,6,FEating fruit and vegetable scraps such
OL,7,Fas peels and stalks could provide a
OL,8,Fhealth boost that most of us are
OL,9,Fmissing, say UK researchers.
OL,11,FThey say scraps are an overlooked
OL,12,Fsource of dietary fibre and are
OL,13,Fencouraging people to try "root-to-tip"
OL,14,Feating, including watermelon rind,
OL,15,Fpineapple core and butternut squash
OL,16,Fseeds.
OL,18,FMost adults do not get enough fibre.
OL,19,FOfficial figures show only 4% meet the
OL,20,Frecommended 30g a day, despite its
OL,21,Fwell-known benefits for gut health.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
